    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I've heard people talk about \"ghost notes\" or certain frequencies that seem to pop up unexpectedly in a performance. Is there a specific way those higher, less predictable overtones change the way a listener perceives the \"character\" of the instrument?",
